      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"sit in the crater\"? that's just poetic, but it doesn't change the fact that there's no point. everyone's already moved on or they're looking at me like i'm a cautionary tale. there's no \"next chapter\" when the story's already finished. sometimes i think the only way to actually stop the shame is to just... let the silence happen. to just stop fighting a battle that's already been lost.",
